abstract: >-
  Code, case definitions, completed results and sealed evidence for two controlled
  studies of regression-testing acquisition costs, impact-history interactions,
  operational judgments and frozen history gating. Recorded-outcome replay and
  fresh native executions are documented separately. The artifact supports a
  bounded empirical characterization rather than portable selection guidance.
